WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:02.467
Welcome, everybody.
Enjoy yourself.

00:00:02.467 --> 00:00:04.934
Welcome, welcome.
Welcome to "The Tonight Show."

00:00:04.934 --> 00:00:07.667
You are here.
Thank you for watching.

00:00:08.734 --> 00:00:09.834
I'm very excited about this.

00:00:09.834 --> 00:00:11.934
Rosie O'Donnell is
on the show tonight!

00:00:11.934 --> 00:00:15.667
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:15.667 --> 00:00:17.667
And Suga is here!

00:00:17.667 --> 00:00:21.067
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:24.868 --> 00:00:29.801
[ Cheers and applause continue ]

00:00:29.801 --> 00:00:31.334
It's a big night.

00:00:31.334 --> 00:00:33.667
It's a big night for us
because we've done close to 100

00:00:33.667 --> 00:00:35.734
shows this year
and they've all been Suga-free.

00:00:35.734 --> 00:00:38.033
[ Laughter ]

00:00:38.033 --> 00:00:40.567
Well, you guys,
"The Super Mario Bros. Movie"

00:00:40.567 --> 00:00:42.834
is number one
at the box office right now.

00:00:42.834 --> 00:00:45.367
And we thought with Suga
here tonight,

00:00:45.367 --> 00:00:47.400
we combine music
from the biggest movie

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:49.467
with dancing
from the biggest pop star.

00:00:49.467 --> 00:00:50.701
Let's see what happens.

00:00:50.701 --> 00:00:53.667
[ "Super Mario Bros. Hurry Up"
plays ]

00:00:53.667 --> 00:01:02.200
♪♪

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:03.167
[ Coin dings ]

00:01:03.167 --> 00:01:04.400
-Yeah, that's the way to do it.

00:01:04.400 --> 00:01:05.667
[ Cheers and applause ]
Come on.

00:01:05.667 --> 00:01:07.400
That's the way to do it.

00:01:08.567 --> 00:01:10.734
Oh, there's a buzz
in the building today.

00:01:10.734 --> 00:01:12.033
There's a buzz in the building.

00:01:12.033 --> 00:01:13.567
Well, there's a lot going on
in New York City.

00:01:13.567 --> 00:01:17.767
I mean, earlier tonight
was the 2023 Met Gala.

00:01:17.767 --> 00:01:20.534
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:20.534 --> 00:01:22.100
I was honored to be there.

00:01:22.100 --> 00:01:24.501
Although picking an outfit
can be very stressful.

00:01:24.501 --> 00:01:26.167
I mean, you spend
all weekend

00:01:26.167 --> 00:01:27.968
wondering which chandelier
can I turn into a hat?

00:01:27.968 --> 00:01:30.200
You know? It was a fun night,

00:01:30.200 --> 00:01:32.968
but it was hard to top last year
when I apparently showed up

00:01:32.968 --> 00:01:35.200
as Kendall Jenner's
ventriloquist dummy.

00:01:35.200 --> 00:01:44.434
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:44.434 --> 00:01:48.434
Tonight, the Met Gala honored
fashion designer Karl Lagerfeld.

00:01:48.434 --> 00:01:50.701
Here's a classic photo of Karl.

00:01:50.701 --> 00:01:54.634
Yeah, he was basically President
Biden from the year 2099.

00:01:54.634 --> 00:01:56.901
[ Laughter ]

00:01:56.901 --> 00:01:59.901
The future.

00:01:59.901 --> 00:02:01.534
Well, speaking of Biden,
on Saturday night,

00:02:01.534 --> 00:02:02.701
he gave some remarks

00:02:02.701 --> 00:02:04.767
at the White House
Correspondents' Dinner.

00:02:04.767 --> 00:02:07.501
Yep, Biden made jokes
about his age, Ron DeSantis,

00:02:07.501 --> 00:02:09.901
Marjorie Taylor Greene
and Fox News.

00:02:09.901 --> 00:02:11.167
Afterwards, he called me up
and said,

00:02:11.167 --> 00:02:12.868
"Jimmy, I got to say,
your job's not that hard."

00:02:12.868 --> 00:02:15.300
[ Laughter ]

00:02:15.300 --> 00:02:17.934
Listen to this. I read
that the U.S. military

00:02:17.934 --> 00:02:20.167
has been tracking
a mysterious balloon

00:02:20.167 --> 00:02:22.634
that just flew over Hawaii.

00:02:22.634 --> 00:02:24.367
Is it me or does
"mystery balloon over Hawaii"

00:02:24.367 --> 00:02:26.067
sound like a breakfast
special at Denny's?

00:02:26.067 --> 00:02:27.801
[ Laughter ]

00:02:27.801 --> 00:02:29.400
Did you guys see this?
Spirit Airlines

00:02:29.400 --> 00:02:31.567
had to explain themselves
after a viral video

00:02:31.567 --> 00:02:33.033
showed a maintenance worker

00:02:33.033 --> 00:02:35.167
making a quick repair
before takeoff.

00:02:35.167 --> 00:02:36.300
This is real.
Look at this.

00:02:36.300 --> 00:02:38.434
-Some Spirit Airlines passengers
were pretty

00:02:38.434 --> 00:02:40.501
shaken up when they saw
a mechanic

00:02:40.501 --> 00:02:43.534
taping a portion of their wing
together on their plane.

00:02:43.534 --> 00:02:45.033
One passenger
posted this video.

00:02:45.033 --> 00:02:46.334
You can see him
sticking the tape there.

00:02:46.334 --> 00:02:47.801
This tape is called speed tape.

00:02:47.801 --> 00:02:49.868
It's an aluminum-based
pressure-sensitive tape

00:02:49.868 --> 00:02:52.334
that can withstand high winds
and temperatures.

00:02:52.334 --> 00:02:54.534
[ Laughter ]

00:02:54.534 --> 00:02:56.734
-What?

00:02:56.734 --> 00:02:58.067
If you're wondering
what the difference

00:02:58.067 --> 00:03:00.501
between speed tape
and duct tape is,

00:03:00.501 --> 00:03:01.834
speed tape is made-up.

00:03:01.834 --> 00:03:03.534
[ Laughter ]

00:03:03.534 --> 00:03:06.100
That's duct tape.

00:03:06.100 --> 00:03:08.501
Airplanes do use tape.
For instance, today,

00:03:08.501 --> 00:03:10.534
Southwest taped one of
its planes to a Delta flight

00:03:10.534 --> 00:03:11.801
so it could actually take off.

00:03:11.801 --> 00:03:13.901
[ Laughter ]

00:03:13.901 --> 00:03:18.934
Duct taped the wing?
No! Speed tape.

00:03:18.934 --> 00:03:20.767
Oh, my gosh.

00:03:20.767 --> 00:03:22.901
Guys, I saw that
an iceberg in Canada

00:03:22.901 --> 00:03:26.334
is getting a lot of attention
thanks to its unique shape.

00:03:26.334 --> 00:03:27.767
Take a look.
See if you see anything on it.

00:03:27.767 --> 00:03:28.934
-Oh.

00:03:28.934 --> 00:03:36.167
[ Laughter ]

00:03:36.167 --> 00:03:38.567
-Scientists said, "Well, that's
just the tip of the iceberg."

00:03:38.567 --> 00:03:40.133
-Oh!
-There's more.

00:03:40.133 --> 00:03:43.534
[ Laughter ]

00:03:43.534 --> 00:03:45.968
Wow.
-Wow. A lot of blue on that one.

00:03:45.968 --> 00:03:47.801
-Even the Titanic was like,
"I'd hit that."

00:03:47.801 --> 00:03:49.300
[ Laughter ]

